          "gradientDirection": "left-to-right",
          "text": "<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span class=\"urw-egyptienne\"><span class=\"fontsize-1-5em\">“Don’t deny other people’s truth because it doesn’t fit in with yours. Be curious, ask questions, be open to learning something new. You might just discover a new world.”</span></span></p>\n<p><span class=\"futura-bold\">–Roxana “Roxy” Sanderson, <span style=\"color: #ffb500;\">Associate Manager, Product Development</span></span><br>\n</p>\n",
          "jcr:lastModified": "Mon Sep 26 2022 18:56:42 GMT+0000",
